@baseball_game_HostAddress = http://localhost:5293

### Reset Database (Initialize Schema & Seed)
POST {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/game/reset-db
Accept: application/json

###

### Simulate Full Game (Instant Result)
POST {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/api/game/simulate
Accept: application/json

###

### SignalR Hub (WebSocket)
# Note: Use a WebSocket client to connect to {{baseball_game_HostAddress}}/gameHub
# Send: {"protocol":"json","version":1} to handshake.
# Invoke: "StartGame", "PauseGame", "ResumeGame", "RestartGame"
